msgstr "Бутонът не проработи?"

#. translators: %s: an AI assistant's name, such as Claude. Approve is this site's button.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:140
#, php-format
msgid "You'll be taken to WordPress to choose what %s can do. Then click <strong>Approve</strong>."
msgstr "Ще бъдете пренасочени към WordPress, за да изберете какво може да прави %s. След това натиснете <strong>Одобряване</strong>."

#. translators: Free is a Claude plan name; keep it in English.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:165
msgid "Works on every Claude plan. The Free plan allows one custom connector."
msgstr "Работи с всеки план на Claude. Планът Free позволява един персонализиран конектор."

#. translators: heading of the first setup step; Claude is a product name.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:170
msgid "Add this site to Claude"
msgstr "Добавяне на този сайт към Claude"

#. translators: button that opens Claude's add-connector dialog in a new tab.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:174
msgid "Add to Claude"
msgstr "Добавяне към Claude"

#. translators: Continue is a button label in Claude's add-connector dialog.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:181
msgid "Claude opens with the name and address filled in. Click <strong>Continue</strong>."
msgstr "Claude се отваря с попълнени име и адрес. Натиснете <strong>Продължаване</strong>."

#. translators: Add is a button label in Claude's add-connector dialog.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:183
msgid "On the next screen, leave the authentication settings as they are and click <strong>Add</strong>."
msgstr "На следващия екран оставете настройките за удостоверяване без промяна и натиснете <strong>Добавяне</strong>."

#. translators: %s: link attributes, keep them as is.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:192
#, php-format
msgid "Open <a %s>Claude's connector settings</a>."
msgstr "Отворете <a %s>настройките за конектори на Claude</a>."

#. translators: Add custom connector is a label in Claude.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:196
msgid "Click <strong>+</strong>, then <strong>Add custom connector</strong>."
msgstr "Натиснете <strong>+</strong>, след това <strong>Добавяне на персонализиран конектор</strong>."

#. translators: Continue is a button label in Claude's add-connector dialog.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:199
msgid "Fill in the name and address, then click <strong>Continue</strong>."
msgstr "Попълнете името и адреса, след което натиснете <strong>Продължаване</strong>."

#. translators: the label over this site's MCP address. MCP is a protocol name.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:204
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:397
msgid "MCP server URL"
msgstr "Адрес на MCP сървър"

#. translators: Add is a button label in Claude's add-connector dialog.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:208
msgid "Leave the authentication settings as they are and click <strong>Add</strong>."
msgstr "Оставете настройките за удостоверяване без промяна и натиснете <strong>Добавяне</strong>."

#. translators: opens the setup for Claude's business plans; keep the plan names in English.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:212
msgid "On a Team or Enterprise plan?"
msgstr "На план Team или Enterprise?"

#. translators: button opening Claude's organization settings, which only an owner can reach.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:216
msgid "Add for your organization"
msgstr "Добавяне за вашата организация"

#. translators: %s: link attributes, keep them as is. Add, Custom and Web are labels in Claude.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:224
#, php-format
msgid "An owner uses the button below to add it once for everyone. If that doesn't work, open <a %s>Organization settings</a>, click <strong>Add</strong>, then <strong>Custom</strong> (choose <strong>Web</strong> if asked)."
msgstr "Собственикът използва бутона по-долу, за да го добави еднократно за всички. Ако това не проработи, отворете <a %s>Настройки на организацията</a>, натиснете <strong>Добавяне</strong>, след това <strong>Персонализирано</strong> (изберете <strong>Уеб</strong>, ако бъдете попитани)."

#. translators: %s: link attributes, keep them as is. Connect is a button label in Claude; translate it.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:232
#, php-format
msgid "Then each member clicks <strong>Connect</strong> next to it in <a %s>Claude's connector settings</a> and approves access."
msgstr "След това всеки член натиска <strong>Свързване</strong> до него в <a %s>настройките за конектори на Claude</a> и одобрява достъпа."

#. translators: heading of the setup step, where the person approves the assistant here.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:244
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:335
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:412
msgid "Approve access"
msgstr "Одобряване на достъп"

#. translators: Connect is the button on the screen Claude shows next.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:247
msgid "Claude asks you to connect. Click <strong>Connect</strong>."
msgstr "Claude иска да се свържете. Натиснете <strong>Свързване</strong>."

#. translators: describes the Claude screen shown after approving; nothing on it needs changing.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:250
msgid "You'll be taken back to Claude, to a screen listing its permissions. You don't need to change anything."
msgstr "Ще бъдете върнати към Claude, на екран със списък на неговите разрешения. Не е нужно да променяте нищо."

#. translators: heading of the last setup step, where the connection is used in a chat.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:258
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:354
msgid "Use it in a chat"
msgstr "Използвайте го в чат"

#. translators: the quoted request is an example to type into Claude; translate it.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:261
msgid "Start a new chat and ask Claude about your site, for example: “List my latest posts.”"
msgstr "Започнете нов чат и попитайте Claude за своя сайт, например: „Изброй последните ми публикации.“"

#. translators: + and Connectors open Claude's tools menu in a chat. In right-to-left languages, write the arrow as ←.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:263
msgid "If it doesn't use your site, click <strong>+</strong> → <strong>Connectors</strong> and check that this site is turned on."
msgstr "Ако не използва сайта ви, натиснете <strong>+</strong> → <strong>Конектори</strong> и проверете дали този сайт е включен."

#. translators: Business, Enterprise and Edu are OpenAI plan names; keep them in English.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:284
msgid "On Business, only admins and owners can connect it. On Enterprise and Edu, an admin has to allow it first."
msgstr "При Business само администраторите и собствениците могат да го свържат. При Enterprise и Edu администратор трябва първо да го разреши."

#. translators: heading of a setup step; developer mode is a ChatGPT setting.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:292
msgid "Turn on developer mode"
msgstr "Включване на режим за разработчици"

#. translators: Settings, Security and login and Developer mode are ChatGPT labels. In right-to-left languages, write the arrow as ←.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:295
msgid "In ChatGPT, open <code>Settings → Security and login</code> and turn on <strong>Developer mode</strong>."
msgstr "В ChatGPT отворете <code>Настройки → Сигурност и вход</code> и включете <strong>Режим за разработчици</strong>."

#. translators: heading of a setup step where this site is added to ChatGPT as an MCP app.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:303
msgid "Add this site as an MCP app"
msgstr "Добавяне на този сайт като MCP приложение"

#. translators: + is a button in ChatGPT's Plugins page; Browse plugins and Create app are ChatGPT labels.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:306
msgid "Open Plugins with the button below. Click <strong>+</strong> (top right, or next to the search box under Browse plugins) and choose <strong>Create app</strong>."
msgstr "Отворете разширенията чрез бутона по-долу. Натиснете <strong>+</strong> (горе вдясно или до полето за търсене под Разглеждане на разширения) и изберете <strong>Създаване на приложение</strong>."

#. translators: Create MCP app is a ChatGPT button label.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:311
msgid "Click <strong>Create MCP app</strong> in the bottom-left corner."
msgstr "Натиснете <strong>Създаване на MCP приложение</strong> в долния ляв ъгъл."

#. translators: Connection and Authentication are ChatGPT field labels; use the same word for Connection as the address field's label below. OAuth is a sign-in standard.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:313
msgid "Give it a name, paste this address into <strong>Connection</strong>, and leave Authentication set to <strong>OAuth</strong>."
msgstr "Задайте му име, поставете този адрес във <strong>Връзка</strong> и оставете Удостоверяване зададено на <strong>OAuth</strong>."

#. translators: button that opens ChatGPT's Plugins page in a new tab.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:321
msgid "Open ChatGPT Plugins"
msgstr "Отвори разширенията на ChatGPT"

#. translators: the label over this site's MCP address, as ChatGPT names that field; the step above names it too, so use the same word.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:330
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Връзка"

#. translators: the quoted checkbox and Create are ChatGPT labels.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:338
msgid "Check <strong>I understand and want to continue</strong>, then click <strong>Create</strong>."
msgstr "Отметнете <strong>Разбирам и искам да продължа</strong>, след което натиснете <strong>Създаване</strong>."

#. translators: Sign in with is the start of a ChatGPT button label.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:343
msgid "Click <strong>Sign in with</strong> followed by your app's name."
msgstr "Натиснете <strong>Вход с</strong>, последвано от името на вашето приложение."

#. translators: describes the ChatGPT page shown after approving; nothing on it needs changing.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:346
msgid "You'll be taken back to ChatGPT, to the app's page listing its permissions. You don't need to change anything."
msgstr "Ще бъдете върнати в ChatGPT, на страницата на приложението, където са изброени неговите разрешения. Не е нужно да променяте нищо."

#. translators: @ is typed in ChatGPT's message box; + and More are its chat menu labels. In right-to-left languages, write the arrow as ←.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:357
msgid "Start a new chat, type <strong>@</strong> and pick your site, or open <strong>+</strong> → <strong>More</strong>."
msgstr "Започнете нов чат, въведете <strong>@</strong> и изберете сайта си, или отворете <strong>+</strong> → <strong>Още</strong>."

#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:361
msgid "ChatGPT asks before it changes anything on your site."
msgstr "ChatGPT пита, преди да промени каквото и да е в сайта ви."

#. translators: MCP is a protocol name; keep it in English.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:381
msgid "Works with any AI assistant that can connect to a remote MCP server."
msgstr "Работи с всеки AI асистент, който може да се свърже с отдалечен MCP сървър."

#. translators: heading of a setup step for an assistant not listed by name.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:389
msgid "Add this site's address to your assistant"
msgstr "Добавете адреса на този сайт към вашия асистент"

#. translators: MCP is a protocol name; keep it in English.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:391
msgid "In your assistant's MCP or connector settings, add a remote server with this address."
msgstr "В настройките за MCP или конектор на вашия асистент добавете отдалечен сървър с този адрес."

#. translators: heading of an optional setup step: the assistant configures itself.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:402
msgid "Or let it set itself up"
msgstr "Или го оставете да се настрои сам"

#. translators: coding tools are AI assistants that run in a code editor or a terminal.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:404
msgid "Assistants that can change their own settings, like coding tools, can use this prompt."
msgstr "Асистенти, които могат да променят своите настройки, като инструментите за писане на код, могат да използват тази инструкция."

#. translators: Approve is the button on this site's own sign-in page.
#: app/Mcp/Clients.php:414
msgid "You'll be taken to WordPress. Sign in if prompted, then click <strong>Approve</strong>."
msgstr "Ще бъдете пренасочени към WordPress. Влезте, ако бъдете подканени, след което натиснете <strong>Одобряване</strong>."

#. translators: an access level, shown on a badge and on the approval page; a noun phrase, not a command.
#: app/Mcp/Grants.php:62
msgid "Read and write"
msgstr "Четене и писане"

#. translators: an access level, shown on a badge and on the approval page; a noun phrase, not a command.
#: app/Mcp/Grants.php:64
msgid "Read only"
msgstr "Само за четене"

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:52
#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:53
#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:162
msgid "Connect an AI assistant"
msgstr "Свързване на AI асистент"

#. translators: MCP is a protocol name; keep it in English.
#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:161
#: app/Mcp/Profile.php:64
#: app/Mcp/Profile.php:66
#: app/Mcp/Profile.php:133
msgid "MCP"
msgstr "MCP"

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:252
msgid "The request from the assistant is incomplete or malformed."
msgstr "Заявката от асистента е непълна или невалидна."

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:235
msgid "The assistant could not be identified. Its identity document is missing or does not name it."
msgstr "Асистентът не можа да бъде идентифициран. Документът му за самоличност липсва или не посочва името му."

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:243
msgid "The assistant asked to be sent back to an address it did not register."
msgstr "Асистентът поиска да бъде изпратен обратно на адрес, който не е регистрирал."

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:261
msgid "The request is missing the code challenge that protects it."
msgstr "В заявката липсва кодът за проверка, който я защитава."

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:269
msgid "The request is for a different site or endpoint."
msgstr "Заявката е за различен сайт или крайна точка."

#. translators: %s: the signed-in user's name.
#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:335
#, php-format
msgid "Only an administrator can connect an AI assistant to this site. You are signed in as %s."
msgstr "Само администратор може да свърже AI асистент с този сайт. Вписани сте като %s."

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:364
msgid "Nothing was sent back to the assistant. Try connecting again from it."
msgstr "Нищо не беше изпратено обратно към асистента. Опитайте да се свържете отново от него."

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:389
msgid "This site does not offer connections to AI assistants."
msgstr "Този сайт не предлага свързване с AI асистенти."

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:394
msgid "Connections are turned off for the whole site, so no assistant can connect right now."
msgstr "Връзките са изключени за целия сайт, така че никой асистент не може да се свърже в момента."

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:406
msgid "Open MCP settings"
msgstr "Отвори настройките на MCP"

#. translators: 1: the AI assistant's name. 2: the site's name. 3: the user's name. 4: their username. If the grammar needs a case a name can't take, add a word like "site" or "user" before the name.
#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:422
#, php-format
msgid "<strong>%1$s</strong> wants to work on %2$s as %3$s (%4$s)."
msgstr "<strong>%1$s</strong> иска да работи по %2$s като %3$s (%4$s)."

#. translators: %s: a website's host name, such as claude.ai.
#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:435
#, php-format
msgid "You will be sent back to %s."
msgstr "Ще бъдете върнати към %s."

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:442
msgid "This assistant runs on your own computer, and any program there could present itself as it."
msgstr "Този асистент работи на вашия собствен компютър и всяка програма там би могла да се представи за него."

#: app/Mcp/OAuth/Authorize.php:446
msgid "Approve only if you started this from a program you trust."
msgstr "Одобрете само ако сте стартирали това от програма, на която имате доверие."

